	(text "The vehicle bus connects the FC to the rest of the rocket.\nThis is the main communication and power connection. \n\nIt features: \n- charging/supply voltage: not used on the FC but to charge other \n   boards in the rocket\n- main bus voltage: up to 12.6V from the main battery supply\n- CAN1 and CAN2 are the CAN buses. One for critical\n   communication and one for the rest"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.986 61.214 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d52c891a-ecf5-4ed1-8c07-662138da0aec")
	)
